								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1142.msg11271#msg11271">Re: New content not worth it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> September 18, 2004, 11:41:38 am &#187;</span></td>
