								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well this isnt a rant or a rave but I also heard the 2nd epics are hard as well to get.&nbsp; My question is for the rangers out there.. Do you have to complete both Swiftwind and Earthcaller to progress to the 2nd epic we get when Omens came out.&nbsp; I still and missing the damned Shattered Emerald of Corruption. I am hoping that I can progress without Earthcaller..&nbsp; Does anyone know? I tried looking it up on the forunm but no luck..<br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br />66 Ranger Apotheosis
