								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1142.msg11335#msg11335">Re: New content not worth it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> September 21, 2004, 11:11:52 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Fiery Avenger isn&#039;t the paladin epic, but their epic quest does require that they have it. It was attainable prior to Kunark, but very few paladins did for reasons he outlined.
						</td>
					</tr>
