								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1142.msg11349#msg11349">Re: New content not worth it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> September 21, 2004, 04:52:27 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thanks guys for the info about the ranger epic 2.0.&nbsp; Any ranger out here now how to start the new epic? Plus have any of the rangers on the server completed it so far? Wondering if any Ascent (rangers) have done it. They are likely to the the first to complete it.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br />66 Ranger Apotheosis
						</td>
					</tr>
